OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1787102284
OL,3,CInside the rare, 11-hour operation to
OL,4,Cremove 7kg tumour from man's neck
OL,6,FITV News Reporter Ellie Pitt was given
OL,7,Fexclusive access to film an
OL,8,Funprecedented and extraordinary life-
OL,9,Fsaving operation involving teams of
OL,10,Ftop surgeons from four leading
OL,11,Fhospitals
OL,13,FWarning: This report contains details
OL,14,Fand images of surgery
OL,16,FBrandon Lee has been living with a
OL,17,Fcancerous tumour in his neck for over
OL,18,Fa year.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
