PN,31102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1787102284
OL,3,CInside the rare, 11-hour operation to
OL,4,Cremove 7kg tumour from man's neck
OL,6,FThe 26-year-old, from London, has a
OL,7,Fhereditary condition called multiple
OL,8,Fexostoses syndrome (HME), which causes
OL,9,Fusually benign lumps near his joints.
OL,11,FWhen he felt a small bump on his
OL,12,Fshoulder two years ago, he thought it
OL,13,Fwas another caused by HME, but it
OL,14,Fcontinued to grow in size.
OL,16,FSoon it had grown from his shoulder
OL,17,Fblade, over his shoulder, around his
OL,18,Fcollar bone and into the root of his
OL,19,Fneck. It was steadily getting closer
OL,20,Fto his windpipe, threatening to
OL,21,Frestrict his breathing.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1787102284
OL,3,CInside the rare, 11-hour operation to
OL,4,Cremove 7kg tumour from man's neck
OL,6,FAfter a series of tests, his doctor
OL,7,Fdiagnosed him with cancer.
OL,9,FProfessor Vin Paleri, a consultant
OL,10,Fhead and neck surgeon at The Royal
OL,11,FMarsden Hospital in London, told ITV
OL,12,FNews: "This particular tumour does not
OL,13,Frespond to chemotherapy or radiation
OL,14,Ftherapy. It needs radical surgery."
OL,16,FThe surgery required four teams from
OL,17,Fthree hospitals across the country to
OL,18,Fcome together, for what they say was a
OL,19,Fonce-in-a-decade operation.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
