PN,31104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1787102284
OL,3,CInside the rare, 11-hour operation to
OL,4,Cremove 7kg tumour from man's neck
OL,6,FRemoving the tumour required experts
OL,7,Fspecialising in bone, head and neck,
OL,8,Fvascular, and plastic reconstructive
OL,9,Fsurgery.
OL,11,FITV News has been given, with Mr Lee's
OL,12,Fconsent, exclusive access to the
OL,13,Fsurgery and recovery.
OL,15,FA standard operation will usually need
OL,16,Fseven to eight members of staff to be
OL,17,Fin theatre, but there were more than
OL,18,F20 in the room during Mr Lee's
OL,19,Fprocedure.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
