PN,31105
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1787102284
OL,3,CInside the rare, 11-hour operation to
OL,4,Cremove 7kg tumour from man's neck
OL,6,FThe stakes were high, and the
OL,7,Fimplications for Mr Lee were life-
OL,8,Fchanging.
OL,10,FIf, while trying to extract the
OL,11,Ftumour, a surgeon accidentally damaged
OL,12,Fhis windpipe, his breathing,
OL,13,Fswallowing and vocal cords could have
OL,14,Fall been affected.
OL,16,FIf a blood vessel had been cut he
OL,17,Fcould have lost litres of blood. If
OL,18,Fthe artery to the brain had been
OL,19,Fstruck he could have had a stroke.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
