PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1787102284
OL,3,CInside the rare, 11-hour operation to
OL,4,Cremove 7kg tumour from man's neck
OL,6,F"It's one of the riskiest operations
OL,7,Fwe will do because...things can go
OL,8,Fwrong quite drastically, quite
OL,9,Frapidly...we have to be alert," Prof
OL,10,FPaleri said.
OL,12,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,13,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,14,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,15,Finbox every Friday morning.
