PN,31107
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1787102284
OL,3,CInside the rare, 11-hour operation to
OL,4,Cremove 7kg tumour from man's neck
OL,6,FCraig Gerrand, Consultant Orthopaedic
OL,7,FSurgeon at the Royal National
OL,8,FOrthopaedic Hospital, Stanmore, said:
OL,9,F"These operations tend to have
OL,10,Fmultiple stages. We'll have a stage
OL,11,Fwhere we remove the tumour and that's
OL,12,Foften what takes a long time and
OL,13,Fthat's the priority and then we're
OL,14,Fgoing to give him the best possible
OL,15,Freconstruction we can, to give him the
OL,16,Fbest function."
OL,18,FMr Lee had his operation on Thursday,
OL,19,FAugust 13. It lasted nearly 11 hours.
OL,26,@xD@OO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/10
