PN,31108
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1787102284
OL,3,CInside the rare, 11-hour operation to
OL,4,Cremove 7kg tumour from man's neck
OL,6,FSurgeons had to remove his shoulder
OL,7,Fblade and cut his collar bone to
OL,8,Fextract the tumour. But the growth,
OL,9,Fwhich weighed nearly 7kg, was taken
OL,10,Fout as a single mass, which was
OL,11,Fcrucial to prevent cancerous cells
OL,12,Ffrom remaining in Mr Lee's body.
OL,14,FHis arm mobility will be limited
OL,15,Fbecause of the bones he has lost, but
OL,16,Fhe still has the full function of his
OL,17,Fhand and is positive about his
OL,18,Frecovery.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
