PN,31109
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1787102284
OL,3,CInside the rare, 11-hour operation to
OL,4,Cremove 7kg tumour from man's neck
OL,6,F"I already feel more confident now
OL,7,Fthat it's gone," Brandon told ITV News
OL,8,Ftwo days after the surgery.
OL,10,F"I'm more comfortable now to do things
OL,11,Fand socialise a bit more with everyone
OL,12,Felse, because it was a big, massive
OL,13,Ftumour in the shoulder where I
OL,14,Fcouldn't really rotate my head too
OL,15,Fmuch. I couldn't really do a lot of
OL,16,Fthings."
OL,26,@nD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/10
