CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1787102284
OL,3,CInside the rare, 11-hour operation to
OL,4,Cremove 7kg tumour from man's neck
OL,6,FIt was one of the most complex
OL,7,Fsurgeries the hospital had ever seen.
OL,8,FA once-in-a-lifetime surgery for the
OL,9,Fteam involved, and a life-changing one
OL,10,Ffor Brandon.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/10
